## Node 3: destination — receives bundles 1, 2, 4 and generates delivery CRS
1
a scheme ipn 'ipnfw' 'ipnadminep'
a endpoint ipn:3.0 x
a endpoint ipn:3.1 x
a protocol udp 1400 100
a induct udp 127.0.0.1:4583 udpcli
a outduct udp 127.0.0.1:4582 udpclo
r 'ipnadmin node.ipnrc'
m custodymode orangebook
m srmode compressed
m cbraggr 1 3 10
s
